{
 "bodyHtml": "<a class=\"wd-skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<h1 id=\"launch-checklist\">Launch checklist</h1>\n<p>Tick each item. The count and the percentage follow your boxes. Trust this document to turn the boxes on.</p>\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"design\":false}</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"copy\":false}</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"ship\":false}</script>\n<div class=\"wd-checkboxes\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Design\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"design\" value=\"Design approved\" data-wd-bind-input=\"design\"> Design approved</label></div>\n<div class=\"wd-checkboxes\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Copy\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"copy\" value=\"Copy written\" data-wd-bind-input=\"copy\"> Copy written</label></div>\n<div class=\"wd-checkboxes\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Ship\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"ship\" value=\"Shipped\" data-wd-bind-input=\"ship\"> Shipped</label></div>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"left\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;L&quot;,3],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;design&quot;]],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;copy&quot;]],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;ship&quot;]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"left\":3}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"raw\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;/&quot;,[&quot;*&quot;,[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;L&quot;,3],[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;left&quot;]],[&quot;L&quot;,100]],[&quot;L&quot;,3]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"raw\":0}</script>\n<span data-wd-computed data-wd-computed-key=\"percent\" data-wd-computed-expr=\"[&quot;-&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;raw&quot;],[&quot;%&quot;,[&quot;S&quot;,&quot;raw&quot;],[&quot;L&quot;,1]]]\"></span><script type=\"application/json\" data-wd-state>{\"percent\":0}</script>\n<p>Left to do: <span data-wd-bind=\"left\">3</span> of 3. Progress: <span data-wd-bind=\"percent\">0</span>%.</p>\n<p>Ticks are temporary preview state. Saving the document saves the source, not your ticks.</p>\n\n</main>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/__wd/runtime.js\"></script>",
